{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01BvgkB7PXYjCDAtMFFC2cjV", "type": "tool_result", "content": "{\"result\":\"### mcp:orders/get_orders\\n\\nFetch all order records in one bulk response.\\n\\n**Call**: `await orders_get_orders()`\\n\\n**Parameters**\\n*(no parameters)*\\n\\n**Returns**\\n- `result` (object[], required)\\n\\nRules for execute_code snippets: every binding is async \u2014 always `await`; call capability functions with keywords exactly as shown (positional calls fail on the default backend); awaiting a capability returns the tool's plain value, already unwrapped \u2014 never index into a ['result'] or ['value'] envelope; `return` a JSON-shaped value.\\nCalls dispatch when invoked, not when awaited \u2014 fan out slow tools instead of paying N x latency: `futures = [fn(x=i) for i in ids]` then `results = [await f for f in futures]`.\\nThe namespace also binds surfaces search does not list: `save_result`/`load_result`.\\nDetails only when needed: toolplane://namespace (full manifest) and skill://driving-toolplane/SKILL.md (conventions).\"}"}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "9cb635fe-2005-46a1-aba3-8285db3ed324", "uuid": "54a792f5-7d69-490f-a1b1-6e0499c71f56", "timestamp": "2026-10-10T12:56:54.810Z", "tool_use_result": {"content": "{\"result\":\"### mcp:orders/get_orders\\n\\nFetch all order records in one bulk response.\\n\\n**Call**: `await orders_get_orders()`\\n\\n**Parameters**\\n*(no parameters)*\\n\\n**Returns**\\n- `result` (object[], required)\\n\\nRules for execute_code snippets: every binding is async \u2014 always `await`; call capability functions with keywords exactly as shown (positional calls fail on the default backend); awaiting a capability returns the tool's plain value, already unwrapped \u2014 never index into a ['result'] or ['value'] envelope; `return` a JSON-shaped value.\\nCalls dispatch when invoked, not when awaited \u2014 fan out slow tools instead of paying N x latency